    "title": "Rose Byrne, Demi Lovato, & More Step Out to Promote 'TOW' Movie in NYC - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Just Jared ,\n2 hours ago Rose Byrne is stepping out to promote her new movie!\nThe 46-year-old Oscar-nominated actress joined co-stars Demi Lovato , Dominic Sessa , and Simon Rex at a special screening of their new movie TOW on Wednesday night (March 18) held at Regal Union Square in New York City.\nAlso in attendance was director Stephanie Laing .\nKeep reading to find out more… Here’s the synopsis: “Based on a true story, TOW follows Amanda Ogle ( Byrne ), a woman living in her aging Toyota Camry on the streets of Seattle. When her car — her only lifeline — is stolen and impounded, Amanda is thrust into a relentless legal battle against an indifferent system. What begins as a fight to reclaim her car evolves into a deeply human story of resilience, dignity, and the power of one woman’s voice in the face of systemic failure.”\nOctavia Spencer , Ariana DeBose , Elsie Fisher , and Corbin Bernsen also star in the movie.\nTOW hits theaters on Friday, March 20. Watch the trailer here !\nClick through the gallery for 25+ pictures of the cast at the screening…",
